+
+    **Customizing with keyword arguments:**
+
+    Override default settings for higher resolution figures:
+
+    >>> pl = pv_plot_surface(  # doctest: +SKIP
+    ...     (data_L, data_R),
+    ...     template="fsaverage5",
+    ...     surf="inflated",
+    ...     plotter_kws={'window_size': (2000, 1500)},  # Higher resolution
